    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I was traveling, then on my return, there was your letter.",
      "path": "audio/1970-97/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.018163,
      "end": 5.639683
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "You can meet friends of Jeevan Jagruti Kendra and begin working for Yuvak Kranti Dal (Revolutionary Youth Force).",
      "path": "audio/1970-97/03.mp3",
      "start": 7.0746709999999995,
      "end": 14.052608
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "There are no rules about it - there can never be rules in revolution.",
      "path": "audio/1970-97/04.mp3",
      "start": 15.550975000000001,
      "end": 19.568277000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "There needs to be an awakening of understanding among the youth, with scientific studies replacing blind faith - this is all I wish for.",
      "path": "audio/1970-97/05.mp3",
      "start": 20.922517,
      "end": 30.644739
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Do meet me this time when I come to Indore.",
      "path": "audio/1970-97/06.mp3",
      "start": 32.034762,
      "end": 34.351633
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Everything is fine.",
      "path": "audio/1970-97/07.mp3",
      "start": 35.778753,
      "end": 37.175577999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "My regards to everyone there.",
      "path": "audio/1970-97/08.mp3",
